end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Theremin Heterodyne Ribbon Synth. Continuous glide heterodyne oscillator with slow-attack vocal formant filtering, expressive vibrato, and warm triode saturation.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
cable out 0 pic
